# Keep only the small handoff artifacts in Git. Large reports, videos and
# checkpoints remain local and are recorded in handoff/asset_manifest.*.
!outputs/
outputs/*
!outputs/README.md
!outputs/evaluation_machine_runtime_fast_strong_1681/
